                                    </div>                                               -->
                                    
<p>The Eagle with the spread wings denotes the flight towards the sky that is consistently Soaring and rising higher. </p>
<p>The Saluting Elephants signify the strength of the Team members and also abundance.</p>
<p>The Green Earth and the Green Vines in the background represent the Eco friendliness of the Group.</p>
<p>The Rising Sun signifies the source of all life and light. </p>
<p>The word “AJEENKYA” on the flying banner means Undefeated, Unconquerable and Victorious.</p>
